 third parties."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"How data is stored"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"All data is stored in Supabase (PostgreSQL), isolated per user with Row Level Security policies that restrict every table to rows owned by the authenticated user. No user can query another user's data through the application."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"How AI processing works"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":["Structured summaries of your recent activity, sleep, and mood data (not raw database dumps) are sent to an AI model to generate summaries, indicators, and recommendations. The model provider is ",["$","span",null,{"className":"rounded bg-monitor/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-monitor","children":["[PLACEHOLDER — project owner to confirm: ","name the AI provider(s) actually used in production","]"]}],". AI outputs are clearly labeled as AI-generated interpretation, not verified fact or medical diagnosis."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"How extension data is handled"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"The browser extension authenticates as you and sends activity data to our API over HTTPS. It never holds the Supabase service-role key or any credential broader than your own account session."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"Data retention"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"rounded bg-monitor/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-monitor","children":["[PLACEHOLDER — project owner to confirm: ","confirm the retention period the business intends to commit to — e.g. retained until account deletion, or a fixed window such as 24 months","]"]}],"."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"Your rights"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"You can export all data associated with your account, delete individual historical activity, or delete your account entirely (which removes all associated records) from Privacy & Data settings at any time."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"Third-party services"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":["We use Supabase for authentication, database, and storage, and an AI provider (see above) for analysis and chatbot responses. ",["$","span",null,{"className":"rounded bg-monitor/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-monitor","children":["[PLACEHOLDER — project owner to confirm: ","list any analytics, error-tracking, or email-delivery vendors actually in use","]"]}],"."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"Cookies and local storage"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"The web app uses cookies for authentication session management only. The extension uses local browser storage to hold your session token and pending sync data."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"Security practices"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"Row Level Security on every table, server-side-only use of the Supabase service-role key, encrypted transport (HTTPS), and input validation on every API route."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-serif text-lg text-ink","children":"Contact"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"rounded bg-monitor/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-monitor","children":["[PLACEHOLDER — project owner to confirm: ","insert business contact email/address for privacy requests","]"]}],"."]}]]}]]}]]}],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L3",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","s